<title>HONG KONG: HK blaze kills ten, eight missing - HK radio.</title>
<headline>HK blaze kills ten, eight missing - HK radio.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten people died, 70 were hurt and eight were missing in a Hong Kong commercial building fire, Hong Kong radio government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The blaze broke out on Wednesday afternoon and was still burning on Thursday morning, it said.</p>
